{"resourceIdentifier":"4679","resourceName":"Project Reignite: Turning Farm Waste to Climate Action","description":"The agricultural sector in India faces challenges due to traditional waste disposal methods of open field burning and decay of biomass, leading to greenhouse gas emissions and environmental degradation. Together for Restoration presents Project Reignite, aimed at transforming agricultural waste into biochar for soil enrichment in India, with an initial cohort of 5,000 farmers in the state of Odisha. The project employs flame curtain pyrolysis in steel-shield soil pits, producing biochar that is mixed with manure and applied to soil. Estimated to remove 110,760 tCO2e annually and 775,320 tCO2e over a seven-year crediting period, the project offers a triple win: removing carbon, enhancing soil fertility, and uplifting marginalised local communities.","location":{"latitude":20.692399,"longitude":86.503572},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-09-19","endExclusive":"2023-10-20","endInclusive":"2023-10-19"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4679"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"SRCNatura Sure Pvt. Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"NCT, India"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"4679"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"110760"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VM0044"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"RINA Services S.p.A"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"27/08/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 16/10/2023 - 15/